<rtept lat="52.0961400000" lon="-1.5029600000">
<time>2025-08-10T07:57:59Z</time>
<name>Peacock Lane to Clearing</name>
<desc><![CDATA[Turn left to walk down Peacock Lane and, as it ends in front of a private driveway, turn left down a discrete waymarked turning and almost immediately cross a ditch (note the knee level stone carving in the wall) into a field. 

Turn right and walk up the ridge and furrow field and across the next field - more ridge and furrows - and over a stile into woodland. Cross the track immediately after the stile and follow the path straight ahead, which climbs swiftly through the woodland for a short distance before leveling out with a steep drop on the left.

Carry on along the path in the woodland, passing farm buildings visible through the trees on the right, until the path exits in to a concrete-surfaced clearing.]]></desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
<extensions>
<xstyle:fill>
<xstyle:color>ff0000</xstyle:color>
</xstyle:fill>
</extensions>
</rtept>
