<rtept lat="52.0838740000" lon="-1.4532050000">
<time>2025-08-10T07:57:59Z</time>
<name>Green Metal Building to Road Crossing</name>
<desc><![CDATA[Bear left round the green metal building, rising to a wide grassy track and turn left. Follow this track along the valley side until, with a building in the distance, the track splits. 

Bear left and now follow the clear path and signage for the Macmillan Way across rolling fields and then along a dirt track for 1.5 miles until it reaches a road.]]></desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
<extensions>
<xstyle:fill>
<xstyle:color>ff0000</xstyle:color>
</xstyle:fill>
</extensions>
</rtept>
