<rtept lat="52.0824540000" lon="-1.4560750000">
<time>2025-08-10T07:57:59Z</time>
<name>D'Arcy Dalton Way Post to Green Metal Building</name>
<desc>Turn left onto the footpath and follow it as it leads you between a couple of houses, down a field, across a stile and footbridge over the Sor Brook to the green metal building on the other side.</desc>
<sym>Flag</sym>
<type>Marks</type>
